            <ArticleTitle>Two Draft Genome Sequences of Sphingobacterium sp. Strains Isolated from Honey.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01364-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01364-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Here, we report two annotated draft genome sequences of Sphingobacterium sp. strains isolated from honey. The genomes of strains 1.A.4 and 1.A.5 show a limited similarity to each other and to genomes of other Sphingobacterium species, indicating that these isolates may represent new species.</AbstractText>
